Package: nidooffice-cli
Version: 0.1.0
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18)
Recommends: nidoagent-cli
Maintainer: Nido Holdings <support@nido-holdings.com>
Homepage: https://nido-holdings.com
Description: GenOffice CLI for Ubuntu-Nido document workflows
 Headless document engine for creating, converting, and editing DOCX, PPTX,
 and PDF files from the terminal or through NidoAgent. Powered by the
 GenOffice WASM pipeline (Apache-2.0).
